| < 100k items, infrequent          | LINQ — readability wins     |
| Complex multi-stage queries       | LINQ — composability wins   |
| > 5M items, hot path, frequent    | `for` loop — performance wins |
| Real-time / low-latency systems   | `for` loop — predictable    |
| Code reviewed by team valuing clarity | LINQ — maintainability wins |

