### Code Examples

#### Optimized `for` Loop
```csharp
public List<int> FilterWithForLoop(List<int> source)
{
    // Pre-count matches to avoid resizing (two-pass, but optimal for large collections)
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < source.Count; i++)
    {
        if (source[i] > 0)
            count++;
    }

    var result = new List<int>(count);
    for (int i = 0; i < source.Count; i++)
    {
        if (source[i] > 0)
            result.Add(source[i]);
    }

    return result;
}
```

#### LINQ Approach
