| Parser | Time (ms) | Allocations | GC Pressure |
|----------|---------------------|------------------|
| **C++ (simdjson)** | **15–25 ms** | Near-zero (reuse buffers) | None |
| **Go (json-iterator)** | 60–90 ms | Moderate (reuses some) | Low |
