## 💻 Code Comparison & Optimization Strategies

### ❌ Naive LINQ (Slowest)
```csharp
var result = largeList.Where(x => x > 500_000_000).ToList();
// - Delegates, no inlining, dynamic list growth, GC pressure
```

### ✅ Optimized LINQ (Better, but not best)
```csharp
