Timsort (object): 115,000,000 ns total, 115,000 ns per sort
QuickSort is 35% faster
```

> **Note**: The 35% figure includes boxing overhead. If you eliminate boxing, the gap narrows to **~10–15%** in favor of Dual-Pivot QuickSort.

