### The Benchmarks

I benchmarked three representative libraries on a **100KB JSON payload** (representative of a complex API response with nested arrays and objects) on a **M2 Pro MacBook** (Apple Silicon, 12-core CPU, 32GB RAM).

| Metric | C++ (`simdjson`) | C++ (`nlohmann/json`) | Go (`sonic-go`) | Go (`encoding/json`) |
