## Benchmark Results

| Implementation | 100,000 Iterations | Per-Parse Time | Peak Memory |
|---|---|---|---|
| **C++ (simdjson)** | **1.82 seconds** | **18.2 µs** | 4.2 MB |
| **Go (json-iterator)** | **4.67 seconds** | **46.7 µs** | 12.8 MB |
