|---------------------|-------------|---------------|
| Correctness         | ❌ Fragile   | ✅ Robust      |
| Performance         | ⚠️ OK       | ✅ Fast (C)   |
| Memory usage        | ❌ Loads all | ✅ Streams    |
| Maintenance         | ❌ Brittle   | ✅ Simple     |
