| **Small/medium files (< 10MB)** | `HTML::TreeBuilder` — correctness wins |
| **Large files (10MB–1GB)** | `HTML::LinkExtor` — best speed/correctness tradeoff |
| **Multi-GB streams** | `HTML::TokeParser` or `HTML::Stream` — low memory |
| **Controlled, well-formed HTML** | Optimized regex with `HTML::Parser`-inspired patterns |
| **Your current regex** | ✅ Fine for a quick-and-dirty internal tool, ❌ not for production |

